    "updated_at": "2018-09-13T06:06:16Z",
    "body": "It would definitely be a mistake for this API to produce layout advances because this is a canvas API, which is presumably used for drawing things. If clients use this API to draw characters, the characters would all end up at the wrong place.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
