    "body": "Thank you for the explanation. It clarifies that I didn't understand the differences between the two correctly, please give me some time to learn further.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, allow me to comment that we would like this API and Houdini Font Metrics API as much compatible as possible, or even unify if possible. So great if we can try to cover the use cases both for canvas and for the layout purposes. I hope this goal is good to us all.",
